  "headline": "Tramadol hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 16.7 days on hand and Corvale General has 29 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include tramadol hydrochloride as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 303 tablets of the 50 mg presentation with a daily use of 18.1 tablets, providing 16.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 532 tablets of the same presentation with a daily use of 18.4 tablets, providing 29 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for the product names A-S Medication Solutions as the registered plant, which received a VAI classification on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That plant also received a Warning Letter on 2017-06-05 and multiple prior VAI inspections dating back to 2009.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E3", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based alternate manufacturer ranked first is Advagen Pharma Limited, which is not on FDA's shortage list and uses Rubicon Research Limited, last inspected NAI on 2024-03-08.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Buyers should verify current inventory against the days-on-hand figures and confirm Advagen Pharma Limited supply availability before placing orders.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D4"]
    }
  ]
}
